  <div class="pl-risks">
    <aside class="callout callout-warn"><div class="callout-hd">R1 · Determinism breaks when attributes become per-player</div><div class="callout-body">No HashMap anywhere in crates/engine; Derived is computed once at load in schema order; the determinism test and the generator same-seed test run on every verify.</div></aside>
    <aside class="callout callout-warn"><div class="callout-hd">R2 · Benchmark shifts or the loader lands on the timed path</div><div class="callout-body">bench loads Content and the two team files once before the warm-up; compare mode judges by the 10 percent CPU and 25 percent memory tripwires against 387 ms and 5.06 MB, not by equality.</div></aside>
    <aside class="callout callout-warn"><div class="callout-hd">R3 · garde raises the MSRV and needs crates.io</div><div class="callout-body">Step 1 bumps rust-version to 1.87 (rustc 1.92 is installed); the first build fetches garde, garde_derive, compact_str, and smallvec, each MIT OR Apache-2.0.</div></aside>
    <aside class="callout callout-warn"><div class="callout-hd">R4 · The teams key in match-stats is outside the contract vocabulary</div><div class="callout-body">Emitted as an additive extra; the observability audit settles whether team.id is a string per side or an array; verify's key check counts extras and does not fail on them.</div></aside>
    <aside class="callout callout-info"><div class="callout-hd">R5 · Tick-file schema 2 refuses every existing .ticks file</div><div class="callout-body">*.ticks is gitignored and no fixture ships a tick file; the refusal message names both versions.</div></aside>
    <aside class="callout callout-info"><div class="callout-hd">R6 · Content folder not found under cargo run</div><div class="callout-body">Resolution order: flag, SM_CONTENT_DIR, ./content, the folder beside the binary; the error names every path tried.</div></aside>
  </div>
